        <descript>
            <abstract>Drainage basin boundaries interpreted and digitized from the USGS 1:24,000 quadrangles.  The basin boundaries are categorized according to the USGS Hydrologic Unit Classification (HUC) coding system. This service is for the Open Data Download application for the Southwest Florida Water Management District.</abstract>
